        "id": "ch6_3-1",
        "text": "Understanding advanced concepts with data\nstructures\nPython offers comprehensive support for data structures, including key tools for storing\ndata and accessing data for processing and retrieving. In Chapter 4 , Python Libraries\nfor Advanced Programming , we discussed the data structure objects that are available in\nPython. In this section, we will cover a number of advanced concepts such as a dictionary\nwithin a dictionary and how to use comprehension with a data structure. We will start by\nembedding a dictionary inside a dictionary.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Embedding a dictionary inside a dictionary\n\u2022 Using comprehension\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
